WEBVTT

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.760
My name is Barlet, reporting for ARUS Golden News.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:16.080
Most of us are simply stunned by the images Dorssian Führer has just showed us.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.120
I am currently located in the hangar of Module 77.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.000
What are they doing aboard the Phantom?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.800
What is the truth behind those shocking images?

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.700
Phantom?

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.950
I have never felt anything this ominous before.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.900
What is this?

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.840
People?!

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.120
What is happening to them?!

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.780
Just what is going on here?

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.660
Dad!

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.910
Dad! Dad!

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.910
Inori...

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.290
Dad!

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:14.630
No! Dad! Dad!

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.900
No! He's dead!

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.270
What is happening here?!

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:21.930
This is a JIORian ship, isn't it? Answer!

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.040
Stop them!

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:23.900
Murderers!

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:24.930
Cease that at once!

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:28.490
What are you saying? That's not our ship!

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:29.690
Ami?!

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:33.190
Ami! Ami!

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:36.450
Why did this happen to you?!

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.450
This is the truth behind Module 77!

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:47.930
We've uncovered the truth behind these heinous acts and took action to stop JIOR.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.840
We stood up against them the sake of the world!

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.840
We were fighting an army of immortals!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.780
Before criticizing Dorssia, realize first the gravity of the circumstances.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:00.970
I will say this once again!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.850
The people living on that JIORian module aren't humans!

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:09.860
They are monsters that feed on humans!

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:46.000
How did we end up in such a place?!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.030
Is this a trap?!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.750
Are we in a den full of monsters?!

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:53.330
I'm expecting an explanation, Prime Minister Sashinami.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.220
This is the first I've heard of this!

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:56.430
It must be some sort of misunderstanding!

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:00.360
We were going to tell you about the Phantom after the conference!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.550
Haruto?

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:03.860
What's this "Phantom"?

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.100
You knew about that weird ship?

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.850
Well... I'm sorry...

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.710
This was a very close call.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:25.240
If the Führer's warning had been just a minute late

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:28.310
we would've become chow for these monsters!

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.870
That's not true!

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:32.170
As per international law,

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:37.380
I recognize the inhabitants of Module 77 as type seven specified dangerous lifeforms!

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.180
It was a necessity.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:43.630
They came too close to the backstage of the world.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.650
It all went according to your plan.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.010
I'm impressed.

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:53.390
I'm unworthy of the praise.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:58.970
Personally, I'm rather surprised at the lack of resistance from the opposing side.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.510
What's going on?

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:01.650
What monsters?

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.190
We're humans!

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:04.990
This must be some mistake!

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.120
What are you even talking about?!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.450
I'm asking what the hell you were doing on Earth?!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.950
Are only the pilots monsters?

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.790
Calm down! We didn't—

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.710
Stop it!

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.470
You're one of them, too, aren't you?!

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:18.640
Tell the truth!

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.210
What are you doing! Stop this!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.320
Don't touch me!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.880
We're no monsters!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.950
You guys are the weird ones, aren't you?

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.340
Why did you really go to Earth?

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:32.480
That's right! That strange ship's yours, too, isn't it?

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.100
We—

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.100
So all of those who went to Earth are monsters?!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.310
Stop it! Please!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.770
We risked our lives for you to go to Earth!

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:43.030
Listen to us, President!

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:44.650
Youhei?

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.450
This is some misunderstanding!

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:47.990
President, listen to—

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.120
He was shot!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.750
Youhei! Youhei!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:59.500
They are not human! They are type seven specified dangerous lifeforms!

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:03.250
They've been deceiving us this whole time!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.990
There is no place for mercy!

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:07.470
We are conducting a purge!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.630
Wait! We're—

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.480
Stop! Stop!

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.720
Don't, Shoko!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.080
Don't!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.270
We don't know anything!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.850
Stop the shooting!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.000
Don't kill anyone else!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.280
I won't let you!

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:29.780
A Valvrave!

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.330
Move even a finger and I'll shoot!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.840
President, you should leave.

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.080
Didn't we have control of the hangar?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.410
Stop... Stop...

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:03.520
Let me go! The students! I have to save them!

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.520
No!

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.650
If you go, you'll just die!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.670
This is the Moon! It's a neutral area!

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.910
That's an accord between <i>humans</i>!

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:14.940
In their eyes, we're no longer—

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.040
To the entirety of mankind:

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.540
I am the President of the ARUS.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:23.320
Today, we witnessed the emergence of a new threat to humanity.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:28.330
In the face of this great peril, we have made a decision.

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:32.430
We must put our intra-species conflicts behind us and become united as one!

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:38.810
We hereby declare the formation of the Dorssio-ARUS alliance!

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:43.160
Both countries will immediately mobilize their forces to the Moon,

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:49.380
and launch an all-out attack against this unprecedented threat to mankind: Module 77!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.090
This is a war we cannot lose!

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:54.320
For humanity!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.260
Valvrave pilots, do you copy?

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:24.270
The united armies will be here soon. This module is done for.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:28.770
Gather as many students as you can and take them to the hangar.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.450
We'll escape on a spaceship.

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:33.560
Otamaya! Take everyone you can find to the hangar!

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:35.260
What about Units 1 and 5?

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:36.690
I got them covered!

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:37.580
Now, hurry!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.450
Don't forget to bring weapons!

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:41.700
I know.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.930
Hurry! Quick!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.090
There are three ships! Split up and board them!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.520
Have you lost it?! She's dead!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:56.350
No! We're going together!

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:57.760
She's not gonna come back to life!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.980
What are you saying?! She's my friend!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.110
Wait!

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:03.370
Sorry, but we can't take her.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.600
The situation is such that we can't afford to save everything.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.360
But we've been together since junior high!

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:09.310
Sorry!

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:10.600
Just go!

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.360
No!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.750
Calm down!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.610
We've overcome crises before!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.620
We can do it again this time, too!

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:22.170
Just believe in each other and we'll get through it together!

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:24.760
I believe, too...

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.880
<i>There must be some reason, right, Haruto?</i>

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.230
This...

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.510
This...

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.440
You can be angry later.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.640
I won't let anyone else die!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:39.950
Let's go!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.970
The ships are already out!

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.730
We'll be fine now.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.040
Right? Right?

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.360
One can only hope...

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:51.610
What is it?

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:53.000
Enemy ships!

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.110
There's so many!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.680
Put it on the screen!

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:02.490
By God...

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.000
Answer me.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.810
You took control of K-Zwölf's body, correct?

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:20.510
You had countless chances to kill me.

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:22.490
Why didn't you?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.080
So you won't answer?

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:31.270
Then let me get to the point.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:33.830
Tell me about L-Elf.

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:41.660
Our only chance is to escape the combat area using the high-velocity launcher of the Mass Driver.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:46.660
Until all three ships have launched, the Valvraves should protect the Mass Driver and the ships!

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.520
We're going on ahead!

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:25.700
You go with the last ship, okay, Akira?

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:26.770
I know.

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:29.140
Escape as soon as it's ready!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:30.460
If you're left behind, that's the end!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.710
I know!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.840
Just one more!

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.080
Oh, crap!

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:11.880
The Mass Driver has been damaged!

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.460
The power supply dropped to 40%!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.290
It needs 720 seconds to charge until we can launch!

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:18.040
So long?!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.260
No way! We can't hold out that long!

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:22.010
Haruto...

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:25.260
We've got an incoming call!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:28.010
It's the president of ARUS!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:29.900
The ARUS?

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:52.490
My memories are vanishing...

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.830
This is bad! We've got Dorssian soldiers on board!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.970
What?!

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.060
They must've snuck in while we were escaping.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.590
They took everyone hostage!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.090
Okay! I'll be right there!

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.120
Are you okay? Where are the Dorssians?

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:30.870
It's a trap! Run!

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:32.120
Run?

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:35.120
What's going on?

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:36.670
Haruto!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.670
Iori, what are you doing?

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:46.550
The President of the ARUS promised us help if we handed over the Valvrave pilots.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.720
What?!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:51.640
What do you expect?! We're human!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:54.600
<i>You're</i> the man-eating monsters!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.100
Iori, stop!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:15.100
Haruto!

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:18.140
This can't be! This has to be a dream!

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:21.380
No!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.620
Why did you shoot?

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.970
Haruto... Haruto!

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:35.720
My father...

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:36.980
He killed my father...

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:45.940
He killed my father and everyone else...

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.580
Haruto?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.620
Haruto?

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.080
You shot him in the heart, right?

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.770
He's alive...

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:06.630
I knew it!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.890
I knew it! Monster!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.600
I...

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:19.770
Haruto?

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.030
Are you Haruto?

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:27.080
Shoko, listen to me...

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.510
You knew about it all?

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:34.740
About Rukino? About that ship?

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.120
I...

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.950
About your body...

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:42.070
Why didn't you tell me anything?

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.410
I trusted you!

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:51.510
I was able to do what I did because you were there.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:56.810
I believed that you'd be by my side, no matter what kind of mess I'd get into.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:02.140
Just like when we ran away and hid in the cave...

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:05.940
We ran away... the cave...

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.060
Haruto?

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:10.580
We ran away?

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.280
When?

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:16.190
My head hurts...

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:18.660
Something's missing!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.160
You forgot?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.470
<i>I know there was something!</i>

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:28.170
<i>But there's nothing now...</i>

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:33.000
<i>What did I forget?</i>

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.680
The Haruto I knew is gone.

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:39.700
What are you talking about?

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:40.300
I'm—

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:41.930
Don't touch me, liar!

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:47.690
You've lied to me this entire time...

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:59.330
Prime Minister! Decide!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.440
Shoko!

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:12.170
To all Valvraves, cease combat!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.610
Shoko?

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:19.560
We will hand over Tokishima Haruto and join the allied forces!

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:22.520
What?! What have you done, Shoko?!

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:24.830
This is my only choice.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:31.400
It is my duty as Prime Minister to protect the people.

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:33.660
Go fuck yourself!

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:37.780
What do you think we've been fighting for this whole time?!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:41.200
Acting tough now, huh? Filthy monster!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.790
You've been killing people behind our backs while pretending to be on our side, haven't you?!

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.290
Like my father!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.200
Monsters, huh?

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:52.220
No! He's got nothing to do with this!

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:53.920
No one knows what he might pull!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.300
He's too dangerous to take with us!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.770
You're overestimating me.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.330
What's going on?

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.830
That's not what you promised!

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:28.810
Fools.

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:32.790
Did you really think a country's president would negotiate with vermin?

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.470
You tricked us?

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:35.510
No!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:38.510
We've gotta go! Use the Mass Driver!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:41.010
We can't! It's not charged yet!

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:59.280
Why? You're just a monster!

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:03.660
We're not monsters! We're holy spirits!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:10.960
Aina said that a spirit resides within us!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.760
That's why she called us that!

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:17.300
And how can something be holy if it only saves those that believe in it?

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:21.390
Even if you won't believe me, even if you hate me... I...

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:25.820
Stay away!

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:27.870
The hell are you talking about?!

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:32.020
Yamada and Akira, you two stay with the ship and escape with it using the Mass Driver!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.680
But what about you?

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:35.020
I'm gonna save Haruto!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:37.190
Inuzuka! Why?!

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:41.060
Because I've been watching you and Haruto for a while now.

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:45.850
I can't let it end like this!

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:46.950
That's all!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:50.210
Charge complete!

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.220
Crap!

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:56.210
Yamada, I'll take one! You use my shield!

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:57.460
Incoming!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.860
Inuzuka!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.980
Fuck!

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:30.570
Now Haruto...

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.560
Inuzuka!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.260
Shoko's ship escaped.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:55.060
Only you're left now.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.940
At least get to the module...

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:16.330
It's impossible! Please, at least save yourself!

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:21.560
Hey, Haruto...

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.630
Just tell me one thing...

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:30.970
How do you feel about Shoko?

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.640
This isn't the time for that!

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:38.860
I want to hear it from you.

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:42.400
Tell me!

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:48.530
I loved her.

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.160
No. I love her!

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.910
And it's gonna stay that way!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.170
I knew all along.

